  "title": "Customer centricity beyond claims: Why the industry should revisit the policy journey",
  "summary": "For years, the insurance industry has instinctively equated ‘customer experience’ with claims. It is, after all, the moment of truth; the point where promises are tested and frustrations often surface. But the customer journey extends far beyond settlement. From onboarding to renewal, from policy wording to everyday communication, every touchpoint either builds trust or erodes […]",
